  * docs: descriptors.md and CHANGELOG.md name the descriptor choiceUnits word
  * test: the contract header is checked as C only
  * contract dir: x-group lookup typed for the system tsc
  * machine move: the doxygen baseline drops the five MACHINE_* items that
